  "wikitext": "'''Welcome to the IdleCorp Wiki!'''\n\nIdleCorp is an industry themed idle tycoon game served by a Discord bot.\n\nYou can '''join our community Discord''' server by '''[https://discord.gg/N9CH9wV accepting this invite]'''.\n\nYou can also '''invite the bot''' to your own Discord server by '''[https://discordapp.com/api/oauth2/authorize?client_id=601241235474350122&permissions=354368&scope=bot clicking here]'''.\n\nYou can view our market stats on '''MarketView''' by '''[https://market.idlecorp.xyz clicking here]'''.\n\n* [[FAQ]]\n* [[Command list]]\n* [[:Category:Asset|Assets]]\n** [[Technology|Technologies]]\n* [[:Category:Facility|Facilities]]\n* [[Land]]\n* [[Region|Regions]]\n** [[Export|Exporting assets to other regions]]\n** [[Population]]\n** [[:Category:Service|Services]]\n* [[Season|Seasons]]\n** [[Season pass]]\n* [[Reincorporation]]\n* [[Liquidation]]\n* [[Research]]\n** [[Blueprint|Blueprints]]\n* [[Market]]\n* [[Retail]]\n* [[:Category:Policy|Policies]]\n* [[Voting]]\n* [[Premium]]\n* [[Updates|Updates log]]",
