  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><b>Welcome to the IdleCorp Wiki!</b>\n</p><p>IdleCorp is an industry themed idle tycoon game served by a Discord bot.\n</p><p>You can <b>join our community Discord</b> server by <b><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.gg/N9CH9wV\">accepting this invite</a></b>.\n</p><p>You can also <b>invite the bot</b> to your own Discord server by <b><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discordapp.com/api/oauth2/authorize?client_id=601241235474350122&amp;permissions=354368&amp;scope=bot\">clicking here</a></b>.\n</p><p>You can view our market stats on <b>MarketView</b> by <b><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://market.idlecorp.xyz\">clicking here</a></b>.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/FAQ\" title=\"FAQ\">FAQ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Command_list\" title=\"Command list\">Command list</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Asset\" title=\"Category:Asset\">Assets</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Technology\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Technology\">Technologies</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Facility\" title=\"Category:Facility\">Facilities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Land\" title=\"Land\">Land</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Region\" title=\"Region\">Regions</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Export\" title=\"Export\">Exporting assets to other regions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Population\" title=\"Population\">Population</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Service\" title=\"Category:Service\">Services</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Season\" title=\"Season\">Seasons</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Season_pass\" title=\"Season pass\">Season pass</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Reincorporation\" title=\"Reincorporation\">Reincorporation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Liquidation\" title=\"Liquidation\">Liquidation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Research\" title=\"Research\">Research</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Blueprint\" title=\"Blueprint\">Blueprints</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Market\" title=\"Market\">Market</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Retail\" title=\"Retail\">Retail</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Policy\" title=\"Category:Policy\">Policies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Voting\" title=\"Voting\">Voting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Premium\" title=\"Premium\">Premium</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Updates\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Updates\">Updates log</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009085757\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key icwiki:pcache:idhash:1-0!canonical and timestamp 20261009085757 and revision id 1724\n -->\n</div>",
